1
00:00:00,403 --> 00:00:03,640
Ro'yxatdan o'tish taxminan bir daqiqa oladi

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:07,816
Botga /start yuboring va «Men rezidentman» tugmasini bosing

3
00:00:07,816 --> 00:00:14,362
«Kontaktni ulashish» tugmasini bosing va tasdiqlang. Telefonsiz ro'yxatdan o'tib bo'lmaydi

4
00:00:14,362 --> 00:00:20,825
So'ng «Ro'yxatdan o'tish (forma)» → «Formani ochish»

5
00:00:20,825 --> 00:00:24,957
Hovli, uy va kvartirani tanlang

6
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:29,565
Ma'lumotlarni tekshiring va «Arizani yuborish» tugmasini bosing

7
00:00:29,565 --> 00:00:33,695
Chatga qayting va «Hujjatlarni yuklash» tugmasini bosing

8
00:00:33,695 --> 00:00:39,539
«Mulk huquqi» yoki «Ijara shartnomasi»ni tanlang va hujjat rasmini yuboring

9
00:00:39,539 --> 00:00:44,672
«Ro'yxatdan o'tishni yakunlash» tugmasini bosing va tekshiruvni kuting

10
00:00:44,672 --> 00:00:49,894
Tasdiqlangach, «Botni qayta ishga tushirish» tugmasini bosing — tayyor!
